{"v":2,"name":"b-pi-pane-list","description":"The Pane key inspector lists every pane Orca has, local and remote with their host, and gets panes that appear while it is open without reopening. Revert check: drop the refresh before the load reply (first reply is empty) or the push after refresh in PaneSlot.","sides":["b"],"keys":{}}
